{"version":1,"content":"<p>晶片公司 Synaptics 日前向開源開發者邁克洛錫安發出停止侵權函，要求這名開發者停止開發和發佈 Linux 驅動程序 Vino。該驅動旨在為 DisplayLink 設備提供開源支持，在開發過程中開發者使用 Claude AI 輔助開發。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585868.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:13:25.496739+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T05:49:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.076418+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.076418+00:00","content_hash":"efb9b214187340706942f76e3542b2dd706905a17711df6754f22026611108cb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}